### GET all products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### GET product by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/6aeb4edbf307d19caa5c996d

### GET product that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/999

### GET product with valid format but not existing
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/000000000000000000000000

### GET product with invalid ID format
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/abc123

### POST create a new product
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Mouse",
  "quantity": 15,
  "price": 890
}

### Create Product in MongoDB
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SF-001",
  "name": "Office Chair",
  "category": "Furniture",
  "unit": "piece",
  "quantity": 20,
  "reorderLevel": 5
}

### DELETE request to delete product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/4
